Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.71,0:23:28.47,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn华康娃娃体W5-A\fs180\bord9\shad0\c&H2F30DB&\3c&H1A3A60&\4c&H35C4F8&\frz344.9\pos(1074.571,200.143)}其二
